n'),(128,'9780062060563','Before I Go to Sleep','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2011-06-14','A woman wakes up each day with no memory of her past.','/~bdb/images/books/128-before_i_go_to_sleep.jpg',NULL,'S.J. Watson'),(129,'9780735221109','The Couple Next Door','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2016-08-23','A dinner party leads to a missing baby and dark secrets revealed.','/~bdb/images/books/129-the_couple_next_door.jpg',NULL,'Shari Lapena'),(130,'9781595148032','An Ember in the Ashes','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2015-04-28','A slave girl and a soldier cross paths in an oppressive empire.','/~bdb/images/books/130-an_ember_in_the_ashes.jpg',NULL,'Sabaa Tahir'),(131,'9781101998885','A Torch Against the Night','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2016-08-30','Laia and Elias flee the empire as rebellion brews.','/~bdb/images/books/131-a_torch_against_the_night.jpg',NULL,'Sabaa Tahir'),(132,'9780448494500','A Reaper at the Gates','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2018-06-12','The war for the Empire intensifies as Laia faces her destiny.','/~bdb/images/books/132-a_reaper_at_the_gates.jpg',NULL,'Sabaa Tahir'),(133,'9780448494531','A Sky Beyond the Storm','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2020-12-01','The final battle for the fate of the world unfolds.','/~bdb/images/books/133-a_sky_beyond_the_storm.jpg',NULL,'Sabaa Tahir'),(134,'9780345539786','Red Rising','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2014-01-28','A miner infiltrates the ruling elite to ignite a revolution on Mars.','/~bdb/images/books/134-red_rising.jpg',NULL,'Pierce Brown'),(135,'9780345539816','Golden Son','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2015-01-06','Darrow climbs the ranks of the Golds while his rebellion grows.','/~bdb/images/books/135-golden_son.jpg',NULL,'Pierce Brown'),(136,'9780345539847','Morning Star','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2016-02-09','The rebellion reaches its climax in a brutal interplanetary war.','/~bdb/images/books/136-morning_star.jpg',NULL,'Pierce Brown'),(137,'9780425285954','Dark Age','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2019-07-30','New power struggles and betrayals erupt as humanity teeters on chaos.','/~bdb/images/books/137-dark_age.jpg',NULL,'Pierce Brown'),(138,'9780425285985','Light Bringer','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2023-07-25','Darrow faces the consequences of his choices in the latest Red Rising book.','/~bdb/images/books/138-light_bringer.jpg',NULL,'Pierce Brown'),(139,'9780399256752','Legend','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2011-11-29','A prodigy and a criminal uncover dark secrets in a dystopian Republic.','/~bdb/images/books/139-legend.jpg',NULL,'Marie Lu'),(140,'9780399256783','Prodigy','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2013-01-29','June and Day join rebels fighting against the government.','/~bdb/images/books/140-prodigy.jpg',NULL,'Marie Lu'),(141,'9780399256776','Champion','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2013-11-05','The final confrontation decides the future of the Republic.','/~bdb/images/books/141-champion.jpg',NULL,'Marie Lu'),(142,'9781250221704','Rebel','2025-11-04 23:11:30','2019-10-01','A new generation faces corruption and rebellion in a futuristic world.','/~bdb/images/books/142-rebel.jpg',NULL,'Marie Lu'),(144,'9780394800165','Green Eggs and Ham','2025-11-19 06:35:48','1960-08-20','This timeless Dr. Seuss classic was first published in 1960, and has been delighting readers ever since. Sam-I-am is as persistent as a telemarketer, changing as many variables as possible in the hopes of convincing the nameless skeptic that green eggs and ham are a delicacy to be savored. He tries every manner of presentation with this \"nouveau cuisine\"--in a house, with a mouse, in a box, with a fox, with a goat, on a boat--to no avail. Then finally, finally the doubter caves under the tremendous pressure exerted by the tireless Sam-I-am. And guess what? Well, you probably know what happens, but even after reading Green Eggs and Ham the thousandth time, the climactic realization that green eggs and ham are \"so good, so good, you see\" is still a rush. As usual, kids will love Dr. Seuss\'s wacky rhymes and whimsical illustrations--and this time, they might even be so moved as to finally take a taste of their broccoli. (Ages 4 to 8)','/~bdb/images/books/144-green_eggs_and_ham.jpg',12,'Dr. Seus'),(146,'9798985799613','The Scorching','2025-12-01 04:33:48','2017-02-01','“A nonstop sci-fi adventure that contrasts the beauty of friendship and love with the harsh realities of life.” – Hollywood Digest Gravity generators and college classes make living on the moon boring. All eighteen-year-old Madi wants is to finish her training so she can become a shuttle pilot and explore the solar system. But when her parents disappear and the government refuses to help, she\'s forced to take matters in her own hands. Her search leads her to Earth, long-abandoned after an apocalypse. Instead of a barren wasteland, Madi finds a garden paradise and a war that will change everything.','/~bdb/images/books/1a4ea2596b1dcc5df70ee2e2f4c531aa.jpg',14,'Libbi Duncan'),(147,'9798985799637','Ashes','2025-12-01 07:18:54','2018-05-09','“A unique and creative world full of adventure, romance, and suspense.” –Kristen Jackson, author of Keeper of the Watch Despite all odds, humanity survives and evolves in the face of a disaster that nearly destroys Earth. But now the Commander, a brutal dictator from Pax Lunar Colony, seeks to control both worlds. Telekinetic teen Madi tries to save her parents from his schemes, but realizes she must help save the world first. Stranded in a post-apocalyptic American wasteland, Madi will fight to find her way back to her friends and family, while searching for new allies and a way to end the Commander’s violent conquest. Ashes is the dark, thrilling sequel to The Scorching.','/~bdb/images/forms/9762d075dac86f5e0bce50cd46ea905d.jpg',15,'Libbi Duncan'),(148,'9798985799651','Petrichor','2025-12-01 07:23:06','2021-01-28','The Lunar War is over. The Commander is dead. Telekinetic teen Madi and her mutant allies won, but it doesn’t feel that way. Her home lays in ruins, a loved one’s ashes sit in a jar by her bed, and chaos already threatens to take hold as a new enemy seeks power. When justice fails, Madi accepts a dangerous to protect the fragile peace she must travel the solar system, face her fears, and uncover a dark secret that has hidden for over a millennium. Petrichor is the epic conclusion to The Scorching Trilogy.','/~bdb/images/books/5590b4e3cea7d3a3c937d67a1acabbdd.jpg',16,'Libbi Duncan'),(149,'9798888770948','Gachiakuta 1','2025-12-03 05:21:18','2024-04-30','test','/~bdb/images/books/5d67ba4e68aeecdd04b6b798e9deb171.jpg',20,'Kei Urana'),(150,'9780140449242','The Brothers Karamazov','2025-12-03 06:03:21','2003-04-29','When brutal landowner Fyodor Karamazov is murdered, the lives of his sons are changed irrevocably: Mitya, the sensualist, whose bitter rivalry with his father immediately places him under suspicion for parricide; Ivan, the intellectual, whose mental tortures drive him to breakdown; the spiritual Alyosha, who tries to heal the family\'s rifts; and the shadowy figure of their bastard half-brother Smerdyakov. As the ensuing investigation and trial reveal the true identity of the murderer, Dostoyevsky\'s dark masterpiece evokes a world where the lines between innocence and corruption, good and evil, blur and everyone\'s faith in humanity is tested.','/~bdb/images/books/3eba9418e4f687a5a9a13158847b5d93.jpg',23,'Fyodor Dostoyevsky'),(151,'9781974709939','Chainsaw Man 1','2025-12-03 07:01:08','2020-10-06','Denji was a small-time devil hunter just trying to survive in a harsh world. After being killed on a job, he is revived by his pet devil Pochita and becomes something new and dangerous—Chainsaw Man!','/~bdb/images/books/1677c66e508367216c0f30956f2d3833.jpg',22,'Tatsuki Fujimoto'),(152,'9781974709946','Chainsaw Man 2','2025-12-03 21:08:31','2020-12-01','test','/~bdb/images/books/6f81a47ccf235560f7ee63ed40fd79ba.jpg',25,'Tatsuki Fujimoto'),(153,'9781841541013','First and Only','2025-12-03 22:25:21','1999-08-01','The Imperial Guard\'s newest regiment, the Tanith First, has barely escaped the absolute destruction of their homeworld by Chaos scum. Ibram Gaunt, the colonel-commisar, is either going to be their salvation or their damnation.',NULL,26,'Dan Abnett');
